    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property is enabled by default.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 기본적으로 활성화됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e87f626546e4d9b8ae14cb11e5a32c2ef1ae165d6a2bfbbfe482ddc04fc84833",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "When set, the view automatically adds motion blur to rendered content which matches the visual characteristics of the motion blur ARKit observes in the camera feed.",
      "ko": "The system calls thie closure when the input mute state changes, either due to setting the [`isInputMuted`](avaudioapplication/isinputmuted.md) state, or due to a Bluetooth audio accessory gesture (certain AirPods / Beats headphones) changing the mute state.",
      "sourceHash": "48d6f50f9c5cf1632169f6caab5f6734b93964d36e9a9ae39ba4d7761577f8ce",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "![Screenshot showing the before and after case of virtual content rendering with motion blur.](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/355e2c150e6b31f68b1f99074bfa3127/media-3231009%402x.png)",
      "ko": "![모션 블러 적용 전후의 가상 콘텐츠 렌더링을 보여주는 스크린샷.](https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/355e2c150e6b31f68b1f99074bfa3127/media-3231009%402x.png)",
      "sourceHash": "d0ea36a93bfdeb4c9b225acfd3b63d8976f20efa6ea9ab8e1de2eea0f0e8d6e9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "The value of this property overwrites the [`motionBlurIntensity`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNCamera/motionBlurIntensity) of [`SCNCamera`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNCamera).",
      "ko": "이 속성의 값은 [`SCNCamera`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNCamera)의 [`motionBlurIntensity`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SceneKit/SCNCamera/motionBlurIntensity) 값을 덮어씁니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a65e72a06e05c6ebb1fd0a2bef19021a8d1d8dc619bd9f8c71d417788a506a62",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
